Description: Send system events to syslog with option to mute web server HTTP log messages

Requirements: None

##### List all plugin files below preceded by a blank line [file_name.ext path] relative to SIP directory #####

a_system_log.py plugins
a_system_log.html templates
a_system_log.json data (generated)
a_system_log-docs.html static/docs/plugins
a_system_log.manifest plugins/manifests